{"unit_id":"tag:09X2:statement","translation":"集合（Set）论问题<OWNARGEND_0001>范畴（category）<MATH_0001> 是“大（big）”范畴（category），因为其对象（objects）构成真类（proper class）。类似地，覆盖（coverings）构成真类（proper class）。定义<TEXTITOPEN_0001>大小（size）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，对于拓扑空间（topological space）<MATH_0002>，为基数（cardinality），对应于集合（set），由 <MATH_0003> 的点（points）组成的。选取函数（function）<MATH_0004>，作用于基数（cardinals），例如《集合（Sets）》等式（Equation）（<REF_0001>）中的。最后，设 <MATH_0005> 为初始的集合（set），由对象（objects），属于 <MATH_0006> 的，组成，例如 <MATHSEG_0001>欧几里得（euclidean）拓扑（topology）<MATHSEG_0002>。完全如《集合（Sets）》引理 <REF_0002> 中那样，可以选取极限序数（limit ordinal）<MATH_0007>，使得\n<MATH_0008>\n包含 <MATH_0009>，且在所有可数（countable）极限（limits）和余极限（colimits），存在于 <MATH_0010> 中的，之下保持。此外，若 <MATH_0011>，且 <MATH_0012> 和 <MATH_0013>，则 <MATH_0014> 同构（isomorphic）于一个对象（object），属于 <MATH_0015> 的。接着应用《集合（Sets）》引理 <REF_0003>，选取集合（set）<MATH_0016>，由 qc 覆盖（covering），覆盖 <MATH_0017> 的，组成，使得每个 qc 覆盖（covering），位于 <MATH_0018> 中的，都组合等价（combinatorially equivalent）于一个覆盖（covering），来自该集合（set）的。以此方式得到位点（site）<MATH_0019>，记为 <MATH_0020>。\n","allowed_english":["qc"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"big","target_term":"大"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"proper class","target_term":"真类"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"proper class","target_term":"真类"},{"source_term":"size","target_term":"大小"},{"source_term":"topological space","target_term":"拓扑空间"},{"source_term":"cardinality","target_term":"基数"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"points","target_term":"点"},{"source_term":"function","target_term":"函数"},{"source_term":"cardinals","target_term":"基数"},{"source_term":"Sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"Equation","target_term":"等式"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"euclidean","target_term":"欧几里得"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"Sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"limit ordinal","target_term":"极限序数"},{"source_term":"countable","target_term":"可数"},{"source_term":"limits","target_term":"极限"},{"source_term":"colimits","target_term":"余极限"},{"source_term":"isomorphic","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"Sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"combinatorially equivalent","target_term":"组合等价"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"Set","target_term":"集合","context":"标题中的集合论限定"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"大范畴及其大小"},{"source_term":"big","target_term":"大","context":"对象构成真类的大范畴"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象","context":"范畴中的对象"},{"source_term":"proper class","target_term":"真类","context":"对象与覆盖的规模"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖","context":"覆盖所成的真类"},{"source_term":"size","target_term":"大小","context":"空间点集的基数"},{"source_term":"topological space","target_term":"拓扑空间","context":"被定义大小的空间"},{"source_term":"cardinality","target_term":"基数","context":"点集的基数"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合","context":"点集、初始对象集与覆盖集"},{"source_term":"points","target_term":"点","context":"空间点集"},{"source_term":"function","target_term":"函数","context":"基数上的函数"},{"source_term":"cardinals","target_term":"基数","context":"函数的定义域"},{"source_term":"Sets","target_term":"集合","context":"引用章节标题"},{"source_term":"Equation","target_term":"等式","context":"所引用的基数界等式"},{"source_term":"euclidean","target_term":"欧几里得","context":"已验证数学文字叶中的拓扑名称"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑","context":"数学文字叶中的欧几里得拓扑"},{"source_term":"limit ordinal","target_term":"极限序数","context":"控制小位点规模的序数"},{"source_term":"countable","target_term":"